WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with the right leg extended; bend the left knee and place the sole to the inner right thigh.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Square the chest toward the extended leg and sit tall.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lengthen the spine, reaching the crown upward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Exhale and hinge from the hips over the straight leg.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest the hands on the shin, foot, or a strap; soften and switch sides.
